            "value": "La vista previa incluía una búsqueda de recursos no válida. Inténtalo de nuevo o sigue editando el plan de forma manual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't apply that preview to this plan. Try again or edit the plan manually.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't apply that preview to this plan. Try again or edit the plan manually."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudo aplicar esa vista previa a este plan. Inténtalo de nuevo o edita el plan de forma manual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EaseFocus can suggest a search query for a task. Nothing is sent until you tap Search Google.\n\nThe query leaves EaseFocus and is handled under Google’s privacy terms. Generated plans, survey answers, and focus history stay on this device.\n\nEaseFocus does not inspect, save, or endorse the results. For health, legal, financial, or safety-sensitive goals, treat results as starting points only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "EaseFocus can suggest a search query for a task. Nothing is sent until you tap Search Google.\n\nThe query leaves EaseFocus and is handled under Google’s privacy terms. Generated plans, survey answers, and focus history stay on this device.\n\nEaseFocus does not inspect, save, or endorse the results. For health, legal, financial, or safety-sensitive goals, treat results as starting points only."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "EaseFocus puede sugerir una consulta de búsqueda para una tarea. No se envía nada hasta que pulses Buscar en Google.\n\nLa consulta sale de EaseFocus y se trata según las condiciones de privacidad de Google. Los planes generados, las respuestas de la encuesta y el historial de enfoque se quedan en este dispositivo.\n\nEaseFocus no inspecciona, guarda ni respalda los resultados. En objetivos de salud, legales, financieros o sensibles para la seguridad, trata los resultados solo como punto de partida."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, EaseFocus may add optional Google search terms to tasks where they help. These are search suggestions, not links. Nothing is sent to Google during generation or when you save the plan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, EaseFocus may add optional Google search terms to tasks where they help. These are search suggestions, not links. Nothing is sent to Google during generation or when you save the plan."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si está activado, EaseFocus puede añadir términos de búsqueda de Google opcionales a las tareas donde ayuden. Son sugerencias de búsqueda, no enlaces. No se envía nada a Google durante la generación ni al guardar el plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
